{"id":"855e440d9df6186d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion.md","title":"相继式中的显式约束变量改名规则","display":"df-sequent-alpha-conversion — 相继式中的显式约束变量改名规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion","aliases":["72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion"],"display":"df-sequent-alpha-conversion — 相继式中的显式约束变量改名规则","depends_on":["[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print31–32/PDF43–44; local explicit alpha-conversion interface","source_kind":"source-driven-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"补齐同一变量集表示中的绑定改名接口；不引入目录外数学原子"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-alpha-conversion — 相继式中的显式约束变量改名规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1844f67828428aae\" href=\"?note=1844f67828428aae\" title=\"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence\">72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print31–32/PDF43–44; local explicit alpha-conversion interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-driven-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"补齐同一变量集表示中的绑定改名接口；不引入目录外数学原子"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。逗号仅缩写有序序列串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lift}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lift}\\)</span> 使用本册既有接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AL},\\mathsf{AR}\">\\(\\mathsf{AL},\\mathsf{AR}\\)</span> 是与既有所有规则标签互异的新标签；它们只标记以下两个关系，不改变自由变量、非逻辑符号或演算公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_L&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta),(\\Gamma,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_R&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A,\\Lambda),(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,B,\\Lambda)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\operatorname{Alpha}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Alpha}_R,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AL}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AR}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_L&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta),(\\Gamma,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_R&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A,\\Lambda),(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,B,\\Lambda)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\operatorname{Alpha}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Alpha}_R,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AL}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AR}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书两类变量演算在本册同一变量集表示中的显式配套规则。它补足语法表示的改名能力；不能把任意逻辑等价式当作本规则实例。两关系的前提和结论只差同一位置的一对 α 等价公式。书中没有印这两个附加标签，故来源资格为本地实现。LJ 的后件长度限制在改名中不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1844f67828428aae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UInf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lift}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AL},\\mathsf{AR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_L&:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta),(\\Gamma,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_R&:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,A,\\Lambda),(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta,B,\\Lambda)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alpha}_\\Sigma&:=\\operatorname{Alpha}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Alpha}_R,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma&:=\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AL}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_L)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{AR}}(\\operatorname{Alpha}_R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2509,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma$ 包含 [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] 的 $\\mathsf{AL},\\mathsf{AR}$。因此本册的 LK/LJ 是带显式 α 改名的命名变量演算；公式对象本身仍不取 α 商。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"07987a632b1cbf1a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alpha}_\\Sigma,\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]；其标签与原六类弱结构标签互异。"},{"id":"9253008af6fe0ca2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$、$\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma$、$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Rules}$ 及演算加规则操作 $+$ 取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的既有接口，$\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"}],"outgoing":["1844f67828428aae","d940a4cbbc0bf9c9"]}